    "html": "<p>A truck takes half an hour to drive up on a mountain road. The rate at which the truck gains gravitational potential energy is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"10\"></span> kW and the vertical height gained by the truck is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"360\"></span> m. What is the best estimate for the mass of the truck?</p>\n<p></p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\">\n<li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"500\"></span> kg</li>\n<li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"2000\"></span> kg</li>\n<li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"5000\"></span> kg</li>\n<li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"20000\"></span> kg</li>\n</ol>"
  },
